           Login + Profile + Logout content as Spike Test, named and
           toggled separately since its purpose differs; only run once
           Progressive Load has established the 4,000-5,000 range is
           healthy. Example shape: 4,000 -> 5,000 -> 6,000 -> 7,000+,
           stepped via separate invocations, stopping at clear
           unacceptable degradation or the agreed safe PPE limit. Goal is
           finding the breaking point, not just making it fail.
           ================================================================= -->
